    <property title="Name">Sodium aluminate</property>
    <property title="Description">Sodium aluminate is an important commercial inorganic chemical. It is used as an effective source of aluminium hydroxide for many industrial and technical applications. Pure sodium aluminate (anhydrous) is a white crystalline solid. Aqueous sodium aluminate is an intermediate in the Bayer process for the production of aluminium.</property>
